 to=self<|message|>Task: Write Javascript poker game run on browser. Must be standard poker game. Single player.

Hard requirements: Must run locally, no outgoing network requests. VanillaJS. Code concise reduce indentation. Output must be in HTML. First line <!DOCTYPE html><html>

