We need output HTML with script. Single player poker. Probably Texas Hold'em vs dealer? Standard poker game single player. Could be 5-card draw vs house.

Simplify: 5-card draw poker single player vs dealer. Deal 5 cards, player can discard up to 3, draw, compare hand ranking vs dealer.

